OL,3,GNEWSASwim and gym prices set to rise
OL,4,Aabove inflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FInflation-busting price increases are
OL,7,Fon the way at a large Worcester leisure
OL,8,Fcentre, with its operators blaming
OL,9,Fenergy and staffing costs.
OL,11,FThe price of an adult swim at
OL,12,FPerdiswell Leisure Centre could rise
OL,13,F6.8% ` from #7.30 to #7.80 ` if the new
OL,14,Fcharges are approved.
OL,16,FFitness class fees would increase by
OL,17,F5.6% to #9.50, while the price of
OL,18,Fannual memberships would go up 4.9%.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
