OL,3,GNEWSASwim and gym prices set to rise
OL,4,Aabove inflation
OL,5,
OL,6,FBosses at Freedom Leisure, the site's
OL,7,Foperator, said staffing and energy
OL,8,Fbills were rising faster than income as
OL,9,FWorcester City Council were asked to
OL,10,Fapprove the new prices.
